  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0 - Perfect namespace implementation with m: prefix\n    • MathML output uses m: prefix with standard namespace (xmlns:m=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\")\n    • Robust error handling - returns 'input invalid' for malformed input  \n    • Complete HTML processing with error resilience\n    • All OMML elements supported via XSLT transformation\n    • Based on plurimath/omml2mathml Ruby implementation",
